flowchart TD
    start["Receive exact value, certified enclosure, or approximate result with stated evidence"] --> classes{"Which numerical class applies?"}
    classes -->|Class or range undecided| more
    classes -->|Zero, infinity, NaN, or out of range| classify["Apply the documented signed-zero, exceptional-value, or overflow policy"]
    classes -->|Finite and within range| target{"What will consume the result?"}
    target -->|Pair value| pair["For standalone compression, round hi to nearest even, round the residual to lo, and renormalize"]
    pair --> paircheck["For bounded input, check both rounding decisions or the represented sum against its error budget"]
    target -->|One base float| single["Round the represented value under the destination rule; make loss an explicit conversion"]
    single --> singlecheck["For exact conversion, compare exact values; for bounded rounding, check the destination decision"]
    target -->|Lossless storage| store["Encode component type, class, and both word bit patterns in a versioned format"]
    paircheck --> certain{"Does the evidence establish the requested rounding or tolerance?"}
    singlecheck --> certain
    certain -->|Yes| accept["Return with the documented conversion semantics"]
    certain -->|No| more["Tighten the enclosure from retained data if possible, or report loss or uncertainty"]
    store --> accept
    classify --> accept
